# IONOS example

Use with `dns/terraform/environments/ionos/`.

```hcl
zone_name               = "example.com"
create_mailcow_records  = true
mail_hostname           = "mail.example.com"
mail_server_ipv4        = "203.0.113.10"
dkim_txt_by_name = {
  "dkim._domainkey" = "v=DKIM1; ...from Mailcow UI..."
}
```
